							Funny thing is you guys bash Toastie for telling it how it is :P.&nbsp; It shouldn&#039;t matter if he&#039;s off this server or not, he has experience with the game prolly moreso then most of you.&nbsp; I don&#039;t know him, but he doesn&#039;t try to sugar coat stuff or try to hide behind some anon name.&nbsp; Gotta show someone respect who does that and is still able to be blunt and tell it how it is.
						</td>
					</tr>
