							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16960#msg16960">Quote from: Justyse on May 10, 2005, 10:59:52 pm</a></div><div class="quote">Finally after a 10 month farm, a change in guild leadership not once, but twice, new officers, TONS of great new members, and the exodus of players to WoW/EQ2...<br />Conviction has said its final farewell to Time tonight!<br />Thank friggen GOD! its finally over!<br />&nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiliedisco1.gif" alt="smiliedisco1" border="0" /> <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiliedisco1.gif" alt="smiliedisco1" border="0" /> <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiliedisco1.gif" alt="smiliedisco1" border="0" /><br />A special thanks to all the old leaders, officers, raid leaders, and members that helped Conviction grow.<br />Diss-ho-nant, Vosh, Ysababe and Llew especially.<br />/salute <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/headbanger.gif" alt="headbanger" border="0" /><br />And a extra special thanks to all of you that hung in there thru thick and thin.<br />Love ya guys!  <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/hugs00.gif" alt="hugs00" border="0" /><br /></div><br />woot!!! time for some hard GoD and some OOW?
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
