							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16971#msg16971">Quote from: Justyse on May 11, 2005, 04:16:19 am</a></div><div class="quote">RN board readers bashed, for bashing toastie, for bashing others, about bashing mobs, that Toastie has already two-box-bashed... <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm13.gif" alt="cwm13" border="0" /><br />The bashing cycle is complete, we can all go home now.<br />&nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wiggle2.gif" alt="Wiggle" border="0" /><br /></div><br />come on now, for the most part i haven&#039;t box&#039;d the stuff RN guilds are doing for content past fennin ro.&nbsp; but at the same time i think most of the posters here think WAY too highly of themselves.&nbsp; not that i don&#039;t, but when you start doing content that was designed to be played with the current set of spells, AA&#039;s, or level cap, then maybe i&#039;ll care?
