							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							it was a joke toastie  <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm13.gif" alt="cwm13" border="0" /> ya know.. pointing out the obvious, that the subject has been beaten to death and we can all be satisfied that the cycle is complete and... nm you wont get it.<br /><br />as far as time last night, half of us didnt want to do Time last night cuz we were sick of it, but then it was pretty funny to walk thru to phase 2 and, uhmm wheres the mobs? jump off the cliff...uhmm guys? run thru the blue portal...hey guys.. uhh WTF?<br />Then we quickly figured it out. Pretty convenient glitch, but not really anything we could do about it. <br />SoE&#039;s ironic way of setting things straight  <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /> <br />Serves em right imo <br /> 
